/v1/","context":{"app_id":4399160,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4399160-1840310314350392","game_id":"steam-4399160","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fix: Options Menu Display Issue","summary":"In the INORIGAMI HACK DOWN demo, we have fixed an issue where opening the Options menu caused the buttons at the bottom of the screen to render behind the item selection panel, making them difficult to click.Additionally, we have fixed a softlock issue in the storage room scene where trying to access the puzzle again after it had already been solved would prevent you from progressing. You can now progress through this section normally.If you continue to experience these issues even after downloa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T05:42:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314350392","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399160-1836506165571860","game_id":"steam-4399160","kind":"announcement","title":"Fixed a Progression Issue","summary":"In the INORIGAMI HACK DOWN demo, an issue occurred where the game would stop progressing after the conversation at the very beginning. We have identified the cause, applied a fix, and released an updated version today. The game can now be progressed normally.If you continue to experience this issue even after the update, please try uninstalling and reinstalling the game.We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T03:31:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165571860","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399160-1833968530896234","game_id":"steam-4399160","kind":"announcement","title":"\"INORIGAMI HACK DOWN\" Derivative Works and Streaming Guidelines","summary":"Thank you very much for your interest in INORIGAMI HACK DOWN. I am the game creator, Kazuhiro Tanaka. I wholeheartedly welcome players to create fan art, stream, and share gameplay videos!While this is a story and world-driven horror adventure game, I want as many people as possible to experience this world. Therefore, I permit the publishing and streaming of gameplay videos all the way to the ending. To the viewers who discover this game through streams or enjoy streamers' reactions: it would b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T01:29:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530896234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399160-1826362059926025","game_id":"steam-4399160","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing the characters","summary":"Hello, Steam users! I’m Kazuhiro Tanaka, an indie game creator.Development on the horror adventure game INORIGAMI HACK DOWN is going smoothly, and we’ve now completed roughly 90% of the game’s presentation/cutscene work.then the amount of information that can be made public has also increased. So this time, I’d like to introduce the four main characters who will end up visiting the story’s setting: the “Sachibae House.”Daifuku Chabashira (茶柱 大福)The protagonist of the story — a high school boy.De","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T03:18:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059926025","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399160-1825727806706726","game_id":"steam-4399160","kind":"update","title":"INORIGAMI HACK DOWN — Steam Store Page Now Live & First Update Announcement","summary":"Hello, Steam users, nice to meet you! I’m Kazuhiro Tanaka, an indie game creator.I’ve just published the Steam store page for my new horror adventure game, INORIGAMI HACK DOWN, and today’s first update adds a video and in-game screenshots.Up to now, I’ve mainly developed games for smartphones, so I’m very excited about my first release for PC (Steam).INORIGAMI HACK DOWN is a point-and-click horror escape adventure game set in a creepy house known as the “Sachibae House” (the House that supposedl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-26T07:23:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806706726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4399160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4399160":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4399160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4719740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4399160","app_id":4399160,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"bd2e95125a321a5ae5e0e6d169bc1e5b3c010ae8a1ecc7dbf67ee9a679da1f0b","response_sha256":nu